        <mxCell id="b23" value="The node&#x27;s image, command, capabilities and env are identical whichever pair stands at its two edges, so a difference between two runs is a finding about the neighbour rather&#10;than about this node.&#10;Vehicle C is never in the clip, so C can reach the store only through the relayed path — that is a property of the footage, not of any filter in the code.&#10;Not built here: the CPM encode and decode upstream of R2, and the god-view rendering downstream of R4." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e6f0;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=13.2;fontStyle=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="518" width="1240" height="92" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
